<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Shearing - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Shearing - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.94		vs	   13.58</p>
<p> Operating	prft 113 million	  vs    loss 45    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 54 million	  vs    loss 17    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 39 million	  vs    loss 32    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 1.96 yen	  vs     loss 1.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Shearing Co Ltd is a top shearer of steel sheets and plates.</p>
</text>
